# Copy this file to `.env` (same folder) and fill in your own keys.
# `.env` is gitignored — it will never be committed. Never put real keys
# directly in this .example file or anywhere else in the repo.
#
# Both are optional. The agent runs fully offline with neither set
# (local sentence-transformers for embeddings, heuristic-only ranking).

